## 8. Insert Into BST: LeetCode 701

### Pattern

Search until a `null` position is found, then create the node.

```java
class Solution {
    public TreeNode insertIntoBST(TreeNode root, int val) {
        if (root == null) {
            return new TreeNode(val);
        }

        if (val < root.val) {
            root.left = insertIntoBST(root.left, val);
        } else {
            root.right = insertIntoBST(root.right, val);
        }

        return root;
    }
}
```

### Why assignment is necessary

```java
root.left = insertIntoBST(root.left, val);
```

The recursive call returns the updated left subtree root. The parent must store that returned reference.

