## 10. Kth Smallest in BST: LeetCode 230

### Pattern

```text
Inorder is sorted.
Count nodes as they are visited.
The kth visited node is the kth smallest.
```

```java
class Solution {
    private int count;
    private int answer;

    public int kthSmallest(TreeNode root, int k) {
        inorder(root, k);
        return answer;
    }

    private void inorder(TreeNode root, int k) {
        if (root == null || count >= k) {
            return;
        }

        inorder(root.left, k);

        count++;

        if (count == k) {
            answer = root.val;
            return;
        }

        inorder(root.right, k);
    }
}
```

